From 377d2d398368c38d43f4ecbca084c89a68c10530 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: qiyinxi <qiyinxi@foxmail.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 01:37:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] win: restore the body of GetModuleVersionAndType()

The body of GetModuleVersionAndType() was commented out with
"TODO(b/410075886): Solve unresolved symbols linking error", but the
function still returns true, so callers read an uninitialized
VS_FIXEDFILEINFO. SystemSnapshotWin::Initialize() passes its
dwFileFlags to GetStringForFileFlags(), whose
DCHECK_EQ(file_flags & VS_FF_INFOINFERRED, 0u) fires whenever the stack
garbage has bit 4 set. That happens while the handler is writing a
dump, after it has suspended the crashing client, so the handler dies,
no report is written and the client stays suspended forever. On Windows
this shows up as an emulator that freezes on a crash instead of
exiting, some of the time. The emulator's CMake build compiles Crashpad
without NDEBUG, so these DCHECKs are on in the shipped
crashpad_handler.exe.

The symbols the body needs (GetFileVersionInfoSizeW,
GetFileVersionInfoW, VerQueryValueW) come from version.lib, which both
build files already link for util: CMake through version::version and
Bazel through -defaultlib:version.lib. Restore the body as it is in
upstream Crashpad and in the main and emu-dev branches of this project.

Tested on Windows 11 with the emulator's CMake build (clang-cl, DCHECKs
on):
- crashpad_snapshot_test with
  --gtest_filter=SystemSnapshotWin*:PEImageReader* passes, except
  PEImageReader.DebugDirectory, which fails before and after this
  change because its test module DLL is not built by the emulator's
  build (LoadLibrary error 126). With the body still commented out
  (and the stub changed to return false, so that the DCHECK cannot
  fire), OSVersionFull and both VSFixedFileInfo_* tests fail as well.
- The emulator's console "crash" command wrote a minidump and the
  emulator exited in 5 out of 5 tries; the minidump now carries the
  full OS version string.

Assisted-by: Claude Code:Claude-Opus-5.5
Change-Id: I9d8bca4df9900036bd5ab0bff66db637c57066cf
---
 util/win/module_version.cc | 4 +---
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/util/win/module_version.cc b/util/win/module_version.cc
index 619c32b..e062366 100644
--- a/util/win/module_version.cc
+++ b/util/win/module_version.cc
@@ -25,8 +25,7 @@ namespace crashpad {
 
 bool GetModuleVersionAndType(const base::FilePath& path,
                              VS_FIXEDFILEINFO* vs_fixedfileinfo) {
-  // TODO(b/410075886): Solve unresolved symbols linking error and uncomment this.
-  /*DWORD size = GetFileVersionInfoSize(path.value().c_str(), nullptr);
+  DWORD size = GetFileVersionInfoSize(path.value().c_str(), nullptr);
   if (!size) {
     PLOG_IF(WARNING, GetLastError() != ERROR_RESOURCE_TYPE_NOT_FOUND)
         << "GetFileVersionInfoSize: " << base::WideToUTF8(path.value());
@@ -54,7 +53,6 @@ bool GetModuleVersionAndType(const base::FilePath& path,
 
   *vs_fixedfileinfo = *fixed_file_info;
   vs_fixedfileinfo->dwFileFlags &= vs_fixedfileinfo->dwFileFlagsMask;
-*/
   return true;
 }
 
